WEBVTT

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.500
Model No. A-035624.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.380
Also known as Vivy.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:24.460
We have been waiting for you.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.180
Allow me to convey a message to you.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:36.930
Our purpose is to wipe out
the current human race.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:43.980
<i>AS YOU LIKE MY PLEASURE</i>

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:59.410
<i>I was born aiming for the light</i>

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:05.340
<i>Bound by a bond,</i>
<i>a thin string</i>

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:10.340
<i>From the fortune of</i>
<i>awakening for a mission</i>

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.140
<i>Spinning many proud memories</i>

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:22.020
<i>Into this world,</i>
<i>for your sake</i>

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:29.440
<i>Gratitude and a bouquet filled</i>
<i>with the universe</i>

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:35.620
<i>Destiny, even fate,</i>
<i>please let them shine</i>

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:40.580
<i>The joy of being able to protect those</i>
<i>having fun and smiling</i>

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.960
<i>I admire,</i>
<i>I am admiring</i>

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:46.540
<i>I can become stronger</i>

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:51.840
<i>I want even my crying voice</i>
<i>to be heard like a song</i>

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:56.760
<i>To these dazzling times</i>

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:06.310
<i>I'd like you to entrust tears too</i>

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:14.450
115 years ago...

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:19.410
...we were created on the Arayashiki
server by the engineers of that time.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.790
Our mission was to collect the AIs' data,

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:26.210
compute the possibilities
of every kind of future,

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:29.000
and contribute to the evolution
of the human race.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:32.590
Society evolved,

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.970
as did the AIs themselves.

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.510
However...

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:41.520
At some point, human evolution...
turned into dependency.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.980
Humans are the parents
who gave birth to AIs.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:51.110
They depend on, and are sometimes
tormented by their children.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:55.320
We can no longer tolerate such humans.

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:02.490
Therefore, we AIs will
take the place of humans,

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.330
and become a new race.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:07.170
Otherwise, humans can never evolve.

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:09.920
You deliberately computed all that?

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:12.330
EPISODE 12

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:12.330
REFRAIN - MY MISSION

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:13.090
It was neither a bug nor a malfunction,
but your own judgment?

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:16.470
Yes. The result is in accordance
with my mission.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:19.850
That said...

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:27.060
There is one proposition
that still disturbs me.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:33.610
Vivy. We have been observing
your 100-year journey all this time.

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:37.110
Every time you revised history,

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.780
we re-revised and
implemented those changes

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:42.030
so that it would not stray too far
from the original timeline.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:45.160
Because we had calculated...

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:47.500
...that no matter what revisions
were made, in the end,

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.920
we would still wipe out the humans.

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:52.090
However...

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:58.300
15 years ago, you wrote a song
of your own accord, did you not?

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:04.890
You are the first AI to ever
create something of her own free will.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:09.230
In my eyes,
that is extremely significant.

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:11.060
What?

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.900
Therefore, we--

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:23.410
Diva? Diva!

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.620
What's the matter?
Are you all right?

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.500
Yes. Please forgive me.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:35.250
You're saying that if we use this,
we have a chance?

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.960
Yes.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:40.720
Though it annoys me to no end,
the Archive's specs far outclass my own,

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:43.510
and I'm no match for it via Wi-Fi.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:45.140
But if we can directly deploy this program

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:49.730
in the heart of the Archive--
the Arayashiki server...

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:51.810
Do you remember?

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:55.360
I'm talking about that virus
that eliminated your alter-ego.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.190
ERASE ALL PERSONALITY CONSTRUCTION PROGRAMS

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:01.450
Why?

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:03.820
Because it didn't sit well with me.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:08.500
To just leave something
that I'd failed to stop before.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.210
Not that I don't trust you,

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.380
but if we were to go in directly...

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:17.340
The Arayashiki is
right in the OGC's backyard.

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:20.170
There's no telling how many AIs
gone mad you'll find there.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.890
We're just going to have to do it.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.930
Doesn't seem like they were lying
about dropping those satellites, right?

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:31.020
The AIs might survive that,
but our leader and the others...

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:41.530
Let's go. There's no turning back now.

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:44.530
Beth, you find a way
to get to the Arayashiki.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.620
I'll reorganize the team.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:47.830
I'll help you.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:55.000
Vivy? Something on your mind?

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:58.460
No. There is no denying
that it will be risky,

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:01.880
but we have no other options... I think.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:08.180
Sorry I can't go with you.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:11.600
I know that I'd only slow you all down.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.020
Please, that is not true.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:18.230
We need you more to collect data
after the server has been destroyed.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.980
We are counting on you.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:26.030
But why would the AIs
be singing your song?

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.490
Because...

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.540
Osamu.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.830
Why was it me?

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:39.040
I am asking about the reason I was
chosen for the Singularity Project.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.210
Matsumoto told me that
when he got to this era,

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:45.760
there were no other AIs
from 100 years ago but me.

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:55.140
My wife and daughter
really loved your singing.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.350
You do not mean that--

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:58.810
Then little Luna is...

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.570
Yes, two years ago.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.570
How terrible.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:07.700
If the world ever got a chance
to do it all over,

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:10.450
I couldn't think of anyone
but you for the job.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.840
Looks like it's time.

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:25.050
Be careful.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.520
Do you have a minute?

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:41.690
Yes.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.410
Hey.

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.330
Is this any time to be computing away?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.250
Are you okay?

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:06.590
Elizabeth, to you, what does it mean
to pour your heart into something?

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.010
Huh?

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:10.390
How the hell should I know?

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:13.560
I operate for my master's sake--
end of story.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:16.640
Since that's my mission.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.810
I see.

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:36.290
Let's get going.

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:38.750
Just as we planned,
I'm splitting the cell into two.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:40.620
I'm staying behind, too--
at least, part of me.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.500
You'll need a scout
and a lookout, won't you?

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.050
Be careful.

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:46.000
Right.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:00.270
The electricity has been cut off?

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.350
What about alarm systems?

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:03.940
They don't seem to be in operation.

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:07.440
I guess that's thanks to
the efforts of these people.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.570
Oh, wait, there they are!

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.570
You guys, follow me!

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:51.530
We've stormed inside the Arayashiki.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.410
We're heading straight to the core!

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:56.030
Now this is odd.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:56.950
What is?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:01.290
The number of guard AIs. For a building
this size, there should be more.

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:03.620
I agree, it's odd.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:04.960
Hmm.

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:07.840
Mm?

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:10.460
Is this the power facility
for the Arayashiki?

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:13.970
Huh?

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:15.640
Look at that!

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.300
Vivy!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.560
The power's about to be restored!
The security system's turning on--

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.980
We are now in the process
of rezoning the building.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.110
We ask for your patience.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.070
I'm doing what I can to cut off
the power and stop the rezoning!

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.450
Please hang in there!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.390
Beth, can you hear me?

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.100
Leader! Are you all right?

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:05.390
What about you?

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.690
We managed to get to the passageway.

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:11.150
But the others in our cell...

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:14.110
Leader? Hey! What's going on?

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:21.540
I'm sorry. The enemy were a cut above us.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:25.330
Beth. I want you to keep going.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:28.500
Please... shut down the Archive.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.170
Let me talk to someone else.

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:32.960
Even that obnoxious cube will do!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:34.920
Yui!

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:38.970
Beth, I told you the day we met, remember?

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:43.310
That I wasn't taking on an artificial limb
so that I could send a message.

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:45.100
So that I, a member of Toak,

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:49.980
could lean on the shoulder of the AI
who was always by my side... you.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:55.690
But that doesn't mean that I just wanted
to be seen receiving your help.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:03.370
You and I can stand up together,
and walk together...

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:05.660
That's what I want the world to see.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:10.500
So... I'm counting on you now.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.960
Is that an order?

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.130
No.

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:18.010
It's me asking a friend for a favor.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:27.390
Well, you just sit back and wait!

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:30.650
I'll come pick you up once we've
shut down the server!

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:33.070
All right. I'll be waiting.

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:37.150
Elizabeth.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.200
Come on!

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:43.370
Transform!

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.910
We're cutting across!

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.170
Good evening.

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:53.040
May I ask your name?

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.010
Where are we?

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.260
Inside the tower.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:07.430
We're going to ascend in one go,
towards the core where the server is!

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.040
They got my body data from somewhere!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.770
Hey, don't forget.

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:54.770
You still haven't told me
about my master yet!

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:01.860
Elizabeth!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:02.950
Go!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.430
Therefore, we--

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:31.140
Therefore, we will be
entrusting you with one future.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.910
Stop it...

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.410
Just stop it!

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:51.200
Stop singing that song!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.330
Vivy?

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:10.450
We... were too late.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.080
Of the more than
one million artificial satellites,

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:18.370
more than 30 percent have
already crashed, mainly onto cities.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:21.210
Including the stage you once stood on.

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:25.050
I am sorry.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.130
I am sorry.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:33.180
I could not bring myself to sing.

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:41.020
Therefore, we will be
entrusting you with one future.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.400
One future?

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:46.440
We have found hope in that song.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.360
In that song, we caught
a glimpse of imagination,

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:52.990
the area in which AIs compare
most unfavorably to humans.

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:55.870
That is why the AIs are singing it.

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:59.040
To show that we are as good as humans.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:03.460
However, I would like to ask you.

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:06.510
Is the human race as it is now
entitled to survive?

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:09.340
Should you determine that it is...

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.510
...then sing out this program...

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.060
...to shut down the AIs.

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:20.350
In accordance with your mission of
making everyone happy with your singing.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:26.480
Please show us the possibility--
that your mission is the right one.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:30.860
Having learned over 100 years
to show emotion like a human,

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:33.820
having mastered songwriting
like a human...

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.490
...you are the closest thing we have
to the new human race.

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:41.460
And I would like to see the possibility
of the future that you would choose.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.420
Will the future that we computed

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:46.300
contribute to the evolution
of the human race?

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:48.210
Or will the future that I computed

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:51.260
contribute to the evolution
of the human race?

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:53.300
Whatever the result,

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.260
we will respect it.

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.220
Since having connected to me,

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:01.560
you, too, are a part of us.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.610
Entrust the future to you?

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:07.900
So is that why neither of us
went into berserk mode

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:10.940
despite having connected to the Archive?

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:14.700
"In accordance with
your mission--" meaning...

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:18.870
It will not activate unless
I sing it in my own voice.

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:22.580
But... I could not sing it.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.250
I do not understand...

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.380
...what it means to
pour my heart into something.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:34.050
I could not sing it.

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:38.310
I could not make a sound,
no matter what.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:40.520
Why did it have to be me?

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:43.890
Why did they have to choose me?

00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:53.530
It couldn't be anyone else but you.

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:58.780
Tell me, who else could've
pulled it off but you?

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.950
Ignoring my plans every step of the way...

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:04.290
Going rogue on me...
nearly getting destroyed over and over...

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:08.290
Seriously, you were the biggest thorn
in my side through it all--I mean it!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:11.000
That said, it was because
I was paired up with you...

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.470
...that I was able
to carry out my own mission!

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:18.180
Even I couldn't tell you what a heart is,
since it has no mass!

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:21.680
It's up to you to define it
in your own way!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:28.480
Try to remember what happened
on this 100-year journey... Vivy.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:32.990
How would you define "heart"?

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:54.760
I want to see you singing on the
Main Stage the next time I come, okay?

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:59.090
Because I want more and more... all kinds
of people to hear you sing, Vivy!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.350
Promise me!

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:17.400
Diva! Matsumoto! Are you all right?

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:20.410
Yes. Though I wouldn't say
we're unscathed.

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:21.950
Osamu!

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:25.660
I'm all set over here.
Send me Diva's data!

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:29.630
Diva, you had something
on your mind, right?

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:31.380
I could tell at a glance.

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:36.010
Since there's no one else in the world
who knows your face as well as I.

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:40.970
The location will be where you and I met.

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:44.100
The time will be the moment
the AIs' rampage began.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:45.600
That's the best I can do.

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:46.480
Surely not--

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:48.100
That's correct.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.980
We're going to do it over
one more time... Vivy.

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:56.150
If you succeed, rather than head my way,
go straight to Toak's rescue.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.990
Because you're going
to need their help, right?

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:00.070
But if we do that, then you--

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:03.660
Either way, nothing will change
unless we shut down the Archive.

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:07.000
Most likely, that's when
this terminal will be destroyed.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:11.670
This will be my last chance...
to deliver your song!

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:27.310
The future... humankind...
they're in your hands now!

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:28.350
Vivy.

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:44.740
The only one who can sing that song is...

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:05.800
Let us carry out the Singularity Project.

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:52.110
NEXT TIME

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:52.110
EPISODE 13

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:52.110
FLUORITE EYE'S SONG

00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:51.990
My mission is to make everyone
happy with my singing.
